<title>USA: Clear Lake CSD, Iowa won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Clear Lake CSD, Iowa won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $6.900 million of Clear Lake CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.167 percent.</p>
